<title>USA: Resort Income Investors 1996 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Resort Income Investors 1996 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Resort Income Investors Inc, which is in liquidation, said Monday it had a loss of $8.3 million or $1.99 a share for the year ended December 31, compared to a loss of $26.6 million or $6.41 a share a year ago.</p>
<p>The decreased loss resulted from a reduction in the number of assets in liquidation, the company said.</p>
<p>As of December 31, the company's four remaining investment loans had a carrying value of $4.2 million, after $7.0 million for allowances for impairment of three of the company's loans, the company said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
